5. How to Update Your Portfolio in the Future
Whenever you want to add a new project or change a design:

Make the changes in VS Code.

Commit and Push to GitHub (just like we did earlier).

That's it. Vercel is watching your GitHub. It will automatically rebuild your site in the background and update your live link in about 30 seconds.

Go click "Visit" and share the link with your friends and family! You built this! 🚀

